Package: elizaos-app
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Recommends: systemd
Description: Native elizaOS desktop shell and local Eliza agent
 This package installs the signed native GTK/WebKitGTK elizaOS shell, local
 Eliza agent, diagnostic command, and hardened systemd user services. Package
 architecture is explicit because the authenticated upstream payload contains
 native ELF executables and may include architecture-specific libraries.
